# No V1 port

V1 (`AndrewAllison/christmas-watch-list`, Next.js on Vercel) is a **reference and data source only**.

- Salvage: catalogue rows + `holidayRelevance`, `watch_events` + date precision, offline TMDB ingest scripts, Better Auth provider config, festive look as mood board.
- Never copy: Next.js routes/components, Radix/shadcn React components, Zustand stores, admin UI, `user_watches` dual-write, AI enrichment, goals/submissions.
- Re-implement UI as thin Svelte 5 components (runes) on shadcn-svelte.
- V1 stays live on Vercel. Never write to the V1 database, change its env, or touch DNS/Vercel from this repo.
